browse.prompt:
Determine which competitor to research this iteration.

Iteration: {iteration}
Competitors list: {competitors}
Product category: {product_category}

Previous iteration finding:
{competitor_data}

Pick the next competitor from the list that has NOT been researched yet. Return ONLY the competitor name and their likely pricing page URL.

Format:
COMPETITOR: [name]
URL: [pricing page URL]

assess.prompt:
We have completed iteration {iteration} of competitor pricing research for {product_category}.

Competitors to analyze: {competitors}

Latest data:
{competitor_data}

Have we researched all competitors from the list? If competitors remain unresearched, respond 'yes' to continue. If all competitors are covered, respond 'done'.
